From: CEB-GNRD maintainers <bmc@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] webui: keep only the inventory tables that have a backend

The board publishes System, BMC manager and Chassis inventory only.  DIMM
slots, fans, power supplies, processors and assemblies have no inventory
objects behind them, so their tables and quick links are removed.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD board-specific]
---
--- a/src/views/HardwareStatus/Inventory/Inventory.vue
+++ b/src/views/HardwareStatus/Inventory/Inventory.vue
@@ -30,23 +30,8 @@

     <!-- Chassis table -->
     <table-chassis ref="chassis" />
-
-    <!-- DIMM slot table -->
-    <table-dimm-slot ref="dimms" />
-
-    <!-- Fans table -->
-    <table-fans ref="fans" />
-
-    <!-- Power supplies table -->
-    <table-power-supplies ref="powerSupply" />
-
-    <!-- Processors table -->
-    <table-processors ref="processors" />
-
-    <!-- Assembly table -->
-    <table-assembly ref="assembly" />
